{"title":"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(less_log_knowledge)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (less log knowledge)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/8/ed875b927a8cdf3edbd5e21bbeb7df6853d70e41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p = \\sum\\limits_{k=1}^{6} k \\text{ ln }{k}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"107\" height=\"50\" />, the number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/a/00a1a09108a1fd33f264194a3c0d68720146fb1a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$e^p$\" width=\"15\" height=\"12\" /> is an integer.  What is the largest power of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> that is a factor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/a/00a1a09108a1fd33f264194a3c0d68720146fb1a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$e^p$\" width=\"15\" height=\"12\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/4/eb480517d7070d05696eee2481c091dfe6b8eee2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 2^{12}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 2^{14}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 2^{16}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 2^{18}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 2^{20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"418\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let's write out the sum.  Our sum is equal to \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/4/1f4ef702abff5447218c9694facfa54a5f73554c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1 \\ln{1} + 2 \\ln{2} + 3 \\ln{3} + 4 \\ln{4} + 5 \\ln{5} + 6 \\ln{6} =\\]\" width=\"364\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/8/5f8372bd71a290a0fdb2d0f8affc0f8769cb8345.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\ln{1^1} + \\ln{2^2} + \\ln{3^3} + \\ln {4^4} + \\ln{5^5} + \\ln {6^6} =\\]\" width=\"337\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/c/75c53dbc05161fccb55f7247484a7c5e5cec90dd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\ln{(1^1\\times2^2\\times3^3\\times4^4\\times5^5\\times6^6)}\\]\" width=\"240\" height=\"19\" />\nRaising <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/a/a3a59bb1293ee3f6dec19de4019a7178874219ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$e$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> to the power of this quantity eliminates the natural logarithm, which leaves us with \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/4/2a4cce0a3e7edd725449559857d72074e6db5ea2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[e^p = 1^1\\times2^2\\times3^3\\times4^4\\times5^5\\times6^6\\]\" width=\"249\" height=\"15\" />\nThis product has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> powers of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> in the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/a/32a35631e1e126934ead6d2af161e9d250827bbb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^2$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> factor, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/5/d8532fea6e90aca51de5a596c8914b62863d4407.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4*2=8$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"68\" height=\"13\" /> powers of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> in the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/4/d74a82a8242b992d784a77944e00b6869a23ced9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> factor, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> powers of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> in the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/f/7bf8cf167990d3d4a27df8cb8a70727fd8fb6067.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6^6$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> factor.\nThis adds up to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/d/3dd64eef3669eae9368accd17c92faa55dab43eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2+8+6=16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"113\" height=\"14\" /> powers of two which divide into our quantity, so our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/3/bf305d3107114dd6ac991a14d260916102b657a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 2^{16}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"69\" height=\"31\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28less_log_knowledge.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(less_log_knowledge)\">Solution 2 (less log knowledge)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (less log knowledge)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>You could use a different method of solving this, without using specialized log rules but you do have to know that the summation of logs equals the products. Using this, we can see that 1ln1 + 2ln2 + 3ln3 + 4ln4 + 5ln5 + 6ln6 = (ln1+ln2+ln3+ln4+ln5+ln6) + (ln2+ln3...ln6) + (ln3...ln6) + (ln4...ln6) + (ln5+ln6) + (ln6)\nSo we see it equates to ln(6!)+ln(6!)+ln(6!/2!)+ln(6!/3!)+ln(6!/4!)+ln(6!/5!), or ln(6!^6/(2*3!*4!*5!). If we raise e to this, we eliminate the ln part to get solely the argument. We now see how many powers of two 6! or 720 contains, which is 2^4. So we have on the numerator 24 powers of two and on the denominator 8 powers of two. This gets us 16 powers of two, which is answer choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/3/bf305d3107114dd6ac991a14d260916102b657a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 2^{16}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"69\" height=\"31\" />\n</p><p>-kingoringo828 (please fix latex)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For those wanting a video: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iq2X86GFVBo\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iq2X86GFVBo</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B\">2014 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td></